   "backdrop": "#141414",
   "prompt": "Build a period comparison chart like Strava's.\n- Card 344 x 426 pt on #141414, Inter, white text.\n- Header: \"Total Distance\" 15.8 pt Bold. Totals 23.5 pt Bold, the prior one right-aligned. The change in 15.3 pt Semibold #E5F4D8 follows a #72CD29 up triangle.\n- Legend: 7.8 pt dots, #FD5200 now and #46C6CB prior; dates 12.5 pt #BEBDBB.\n- Plot 309 x 210 pt: 4 gridlines 70 pt apart, white at 20%; y labels 11.5 pt on the lines; month caps below.\n- Current: 2.5 pt #F75405 line over #FC5200 at 26%. Prior: 2.2 pt #46C6CB line. Hollow markers, r 3.2 pt.\n- Chip: 36 pt tall, 1 pt #434240 border, 6 pt radius: teal dash, \"Prior 3 months\" 13.3 pt Medium, close icon.\n- States: close hides the prior line. Draw the lines in 600 ms, then fade the area in.\n- Data rule: 1 point per week; change = (current - prior) / prior; even y steps.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
