   "backdrop": "#21211F",
   "prompt": "Build a sport picker row like Strava's.\n- Sheet #21211F. Title \"Your Top Sports\" in Inter Medium 16.5 pt #FFFFFF, 26 pt from the left edge.\n- Row: 63 pt circles, 84 pt pitch, the first 30 pt from the edge. It scrolls sideways; the 5th item is cut by the screen edge.\n- Circle #43423E with a 26 pt white line icon, 2 pt stroke, round caps: shoe, road bike, zigzag lines, rolled mat, boot.\n- Label 10 pt under each circle: Inter Regular 12.7 pt #FFFFFF, centered.\n- Selected: circle #582E16 (#FC5200 at 25%), icon and label #FC5200. A 16.4 pt #FC5200 badge with a #21211F check sits on the circle edge, 45 degrees up-right.\n- States: single select. Pressed scales the circle to 0.94, then springs back. The badge pops in from scale 0 over 200 ms.\n- Data rule: order the sports by use, most used first.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
