   "prompt": "Build an activity stats header like Strava's.\n- Card 344 pt wide on #141414, Inter, white text.\n- Avatar: 37 x 40 pt shield (3 pt top corners, V bottom), 2.8 pt border, gradient #F18147 to #F1631C to #9E3208; initials 15 pt Bold on #2A2A2A.\n- Name 12.5 pt Bold, 14 pt right of the avatar. Below it, a 16 pt shoe icon and the time and place in 10.6 pt #E2E2E0.\n- More icon top right: 3 outlined 4.8 pt circles, 1 pt #C3C2BF.\n- Title 19.4 pt Medium, 29 pt under the avatar.\n- Stats: labels 10.7 pt #F1F1F0, values 16.6 pt Medium, 17 pt cap to cap. Columns at 0, 77 and 166 pt; Achievements right-aligned.\n- Achievements: 14 x 16 pt #F0AE0D medals and a #8D979A trophy, 3 pt apart, then the count.\n- States: avatar and name open the profile; the more icon opens actions; the card opens the activity.\n- Data rule: long names end with an ellipsis; the count equals the badges shown.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
